You know, one of my biggest annoyances is that everyone only uses TROLS! As a dev, I even sent it to one of my friend's team's chat and no one cared! Everyone still uses TROLS.

So, as an expert, I figured the way to fix this would be to make it synchronise with TROLS more often and more consistently. Before it was devastatingly slow.

So now I have Cloudflare! Enjoy. If TROLS receives data at 7:30pm, this website will automatically have it deployed by 7:40 at the latest. Before it could be a day before it would be live.

Have fun!
